{"5006540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Extraction", "steam_appid": 5006540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/f69583cf6a20fea7ff834e48eae8a8c2.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/f69583cf6a20fea7ff834e48eae8a8c2.avif?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER TOKYO. EXTRACT ALIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Extraction is a top-down pixel-art extraction survival game set in a Tokyo devastated by a catastrophic infection. Enter hostile zones, search for weapons, equipment, and essential supplies, then reach an extraction point alive. Every extra room could contain something valuable—but the longer you stay, the greater the risk of losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/403c84b78f41b2fb77fc75f5e66c3f56.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/403c84b78f41b2fb77fc75f5e66c3f56.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/fbcacd03ad4bbbb46f56101b179f3236.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/fbcacd03ad4bbbb46f56101b179f3236.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY OPERATION DEMANDS A DIFFERENT APPROACH.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through ruined city streets, dangerous night zones, forests, and military facilities. Face infected swarms, armed scavengers, elite PMCs, and powerful bosses. Search-and-extract raids are joined by convoy operations, sniper missions, helicopter assaults, and large-scale battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/0a0b37c7829018492bd61b49fd96bef1.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/0a0b37c7829018492bd61b49fd96bef1.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/48ac29fb63bde370f13c9560119f9c40.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/48ac29fb63bde370f13c9560119f9c40.avif?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL REQUIRES MORE THAN FIREPOWER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read enemy movements, control your firing angles, use cover, and choose your battles carefully. Health, infection, stress, hunger, and hydration must all be managed alongside limited ammunition and inventory space. If you die during an operation, the equipment and loot you were carrying will be lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/3f9e38f1afd26c074d58975d6827b6d4.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/3f9e38f1afd26c074d58975d6827b6d4.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A SHELTER WORTH RETURNING TO.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A successful extraction is only the beginning. Bring recovered supplies back to your shelter, manage food, water, electricity, and storage, and expand your defenses. Build walls, gates, and automated turrets, repair damaged structures, and prepare for attacks from infected hordes and hostile armed forces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/a9467bbf319389b526f576a439d2dc4b.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/a9467bbf319389b526f576a439d2dc4b.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY SURVIVOR HAS A STORY.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The survivors living in your shelter have their own personalities, abilities, emotions, and relationships. Morale and mental stability influence their behavior, while affection, resentment, crime, and punishment can reshape the entire community. Watch their personal logs, manage internal conflicts, and keep the shelter from collapsing from within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/f63ffb53685518d467216b7b2a6b4041.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/f63ffb53685518d467216b7b2a6b4041.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT YOU BRING HOME IS WHAT MATTERS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing the most enemies does not make an operation successful. Know when to keep searching, when to fight, and when to escape with what you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive Tokyo. Secure what you need. Extract alive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/f69583cf6a20fea7ff834e48eae8a8c2.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/f69583cf6a20fea7ff834e48eae8a8c2.avif?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER TOKYO. EXTRACT ALIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Extraction is a top-down pixel-art extraction survival game set in a Tokyo devastated by a catastrophic infection. Enter hostile zones, search for weapons, equipment, and essential supplies, then reach an extraction point alive. Every extra room could contain something valuable—but the longer you stay, the greater the risk of losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/403c84b78f41b2fb77fc75f5e66c3f56.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/403c84b78f41b2fb77fc75f5e66c3f56.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/fbcacd03ad4bbbb46f56101b179f3236.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/fbcacd03ad4bbbb46f56101b179f3236.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY OPERATION DEMANDS A DIFFERENT APPROACH.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through ruined city streets, dangerous night zones, forests, and military facilities. Face infected swarms, armed scavengers, elite PMCs, and powerful bosses. Search-and-extract raids are joined by convoy operations, sniper missions, helicopter assaults, and large-scale battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/0a0b37c7829018492bd61b49fd96bef1.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/0a0b37c7829018492bd61b49fd96bef1.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/48ac29fb63bde370f13c9560119f9c40.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/48ac29fb63bde370f13c9560119f9c40.avif?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL REQUIRES MORE THAN FIREPOWER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read enemy movements, control your firing angles, use cover, and choose your battles carefully. Health, infection, stress, hunger, and hydration must all be managed alongside limited ammunition and inventory space. If you die during an operation, the equipment and loot you were carrying will be lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/3f9e38f1afd26c074d58975d6827b6d4.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/3f9e38f1afd26c074d58975d6827b6d4.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A SHELTER WORTH RETURNING TO.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A successful extraction is only the beginning. Bring recovered supplies back to your shelter, manage food, water, electricity, and storage, and expand your defenses. Build walls, gates, and automated turrets, repair damaged structures, and prepare for attacks from infected hordes and hostile armed forces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/a9467bbf319389b526f576a439d2dc4b.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/a9467bbf319389b526f576a439d2dc4b.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY SURVIVOR HAS A STORY.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The survivors living in your shelter have their own personalities, abilities, emotions, and relationships. Morale and mental stability influence their behavior, while affection, resentment, crime, and punishment can reshape the entire community. Watch their personal logs, manage internal conflicts, and keep the shelter from collapsing from within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras/f63ffb53685518d467216b7b2a6b4041.avif?t=1787735563\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/extras_big/f63ffb53685518d467216b7b2a6b4041.webp?t=1787735563 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT YOU BRING HOME IS WHAT MATTERS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing the most enemies does not make an operation successful. Know when to keep searching, when to fight, and when to escape with what you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive Tokyo. Secure what you need. Extract alive.</p>", "short_description": "Explore zombie-infested Tokyo, scavenge resources, and make it out alive. Expand your shelter, manage survivors, and face dynamic threats and deadly bosses in a top-down extraction survival roguelite.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/22fcb01c7638741c335d5fc862c3244c79410f3f/header.jpg?t=1787735563", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/6596dcb3c1a78f52eea037e9fa93942658891f3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787735563", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5006540/6596dcb3c1a78f52eea037e9fa93942658891f3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787735563", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100 / Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti 2GB / RX 460 2GB / Intel UHD 630<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 or AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2026 Studio Paperbox. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["bleachmama"], "publishers": ["Studio Paperbox"], "demos": [{"appid": 5136360, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms